      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d9dde47a36aad2ccff0cfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在得休息才行……\r\n为了不失去梦想……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4523c2c9171fe3b55d39ac6cc7e0c3e6d3726777ac111d4f40ab69a1834d98ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f6b57a4660a8343c3e0d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明白有备无患也是\r\n不可或缺的一环……\r\n而现在不正是该做准备之时吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "db74ae639c3b72cf2bd71372258b5ffaeadc8deee6ff0a2dd4d30b39c372fb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a69a8e0335af38b85473ed75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在超想跑步的！\r\n想要一直跑一直跑，\r\n跑到很远的地方去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b118823f70dcd60bb1b4e6065c43afef2e0683998c77bb77aab018626ac24a1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866c6264481086b94db07050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在是最佳状态！\r\n来来来，不管今天的训练项目\r\n是什么，都尽管说吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4477e749332f4065a7957f0523873f2564d258d22cca5b521edc0254fed92ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac0f61f53587bdf60a517604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照这个状况来看──我甚至能\r\n追上她，并且超越她……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b1e1e54e6a7245872a2e3d0ea00f2744cec05bb4da0e872ba899c7165c996e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d665df9e49075e30a34a99f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就来彻底训练吧！\r\n能训练时，\r\n就得全力投入才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5652016b9abba6b82a3833cd41a47fd2d73d5589c1577730addf464feb525fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1d0d0ed0f3c4f1dc73e70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一点一滴脚踏实地！\r\n确实地累积实力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb9543fdb6832f7a0e4ce64801b799a617bced7bd83449de53ae792ee86bcaba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:386126cb4c83606a6adef733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要一步步向前迈进，\r\n就一定能抵达目的地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96fe65f78c4c74cc012d84c0c28bf6a55cefa842a8dcdd6e024bb6d1f21c54c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d0b23ccb71a6b2619a6fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了达到目标……\r\n这点程度根本不算什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12c1ca62a811f49c08c85b8cb482bb122149513be4b6eba1dde6a000b483b62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
